---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import MailLink from '../components/MailLink.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact — Brian J. Mueller"
      description="Write to Brian with questions, reflections, your own poems, or speaking and retreat inquiries.">
  <section class="wrap stack stack-l">
    <div class="stack stack-m prose">
      <div class="eyebrow">Get in touch</div>
      <h1>Contact</h1>
      <hr class="rule-short" />
      <p class="lede">Thank you for taking a few moments out of your day to read my poems. I hope
         the words resonate.</p>
      <p>Feel free to share some of your own thoughts and reflections — including your own poems.
         Questions, comments, and speaking or retreat inquiries are all welcome, and I'll get back
         to you as soon as I'm able. I usually manage a reply within a day or two.</p>
      <p class="small">Please, no unsolicited business offers.</p>
      <div class="contact-card">
        <div class="eyebrow">Write to me</div>
        <p class="contact-address"><MailLink user="bdrive.co" domain="gmail.com"
          ><span class="small">My address loads here a moment after the page does.</span></MailLink></p>
        <p class="small">That address reaches me directly, and a form will take its place here
           shortly. It is assembled by script rather than printed in the page, which keeps it out
           of the hands of the machines that trawl the web for addresses to sell.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="stack stack-s">
        <div class="eyebrow">What people usually write about</div>
        <ul class="contact-list">
          <li><b>Permission to use a poem.</b> Most are already shared under a Creative Commons
              licence — see <a href="/faq">the questions page</a> first; it may already say yes.</li>
          <li><b>Speaking, retreats, and the January writing retreat.</b> For
              <a href="/retreat">Rooted in the Land</a> you can also write to Tom Sparough, whose
              address is on <a href="/retreat">the retreat page</a>.</li>
          <li><b>Privacy requests</b> under the <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
